      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of trying to live up to others' expectations is crushing, and it sounds like you are trapped in a cycle of self-blame. But your worth is not transactional; it doesn't depend on pleasing anyone else. The point of being around is to experience life, not to perform for an audience that is already judging you. If you can't see a way forward, please consider reaching out to a professional who can help you navigate this intense feeling of worthlessness.",
      "source": "target",
